WEBVTT

00:00:20.571 --> 00:00:22.871
Could you please predict something
for me?

00:00:25.743 --> 00:00:26.911
I'm sorry?

00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:33.497
Move those mouths.

00:00:40.299 --> 00:00:42.696
One teensy little prophecy?

00:00:49.475 --> 00:00:50.595
Pity.

00:00:51.477 --> 00:00:53.896
No, wait. Wait, no.
I think I do see something.

00:00:54.063 --> 00:00:55.914
Yes, I do. Something dark.

00:00:56.524 --> 00:01:00.310
You are in grave danger.

00:01:02.530 --> 00:01:03.862
Lovely.

00:01:14.458 --> 00:01:16.027
Cho. What's going on?

00:01:16.794 --> 00:01:18.470
It's Professor Trelawney.

00:01:41.431 --> 00:01:42.539
Ooh!

00:01:48.951 --> 00:01:51.705
Sixteen years I've lived and taught here.

00:01:52.622 --> 00:01:54.591
Hogwarts is my home.

00:01:57.460 --> 00:01:58.817
You can't do this.

00:02:00.796 --> 00:02:02.189
Actually, I can.

00:02:11.932 --> 00:02:13.309
Something you'd like to say?

00:02:13.476 --> 00:02:15.835
Oh, there are several things
I would like to say.

00:02:16.687 --> 00:02:18.064
There.... Shh. Shh.

00:02:32.203 --> 00:02:36.444
Professor McGonagall, might I ask you
to escort Sybil back inside?

00:02:38.167 --> 00:02:39.988
Sybil, dear. This way.

00:02:40.795 --> 00:02:42.296
Thank you.

00:02:43.464 --> 00:02:47.510
Dumbledore, may I remind
you that under the terms...

00:02:47.677 --> 00:02:50.930
...of Educational Decree Number 23,
as enacted by the minister--

00:02:51.097 --> 00:02:53.076
You have the right
to dismiss my teachers.

00:02:54.433 --> 00:02:57.330
You do not, however, have the authority
to banish them from the grounds.

00:02:58.187 --> 00:02:59.952
That power remains with the headmaster.

00:03:03.234 --> 00:03:04.485
For now.

00:03:10.908 --> 00:03:12.310
Don't you all have studying to do?

00:03:13.077 --> 00:03:14.245
Professor.

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:17.206
Professor?

00:03:17.665 --> 00:03:19.959
Professor Dumbledore. Professor!

00:03:20.626 --> 00:03:22.053
Professor Dumbledore.

00:03:33.431 --> 00:03:35.558
That foul, evil, old gargoyle.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:38.000
We're not learning how
to defend ourselves.

00:03:38.477 --> 00:03:40.165
We're not learning how
to pass our OWLs.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:43.524
She's taking over the entire school.

00:03:43.691 --> 00:03:44.984
Security has been

00:03:45.151 --> 00:03:48.362
and will remain the
Ministry's top priority.

00:03:48.529 --> 00:03:50.935
Furthermore,
we have convincing evidence...

00:03:51.532 --> 00:03:54.410
...that these disappearances
are the work...

00:03:54.577 --> 00:03:57.955
...of notorious
mass murderer Sirius Black.

00:03:58.706 --> 00:03:59.811
Harry.

00:04:00.499 --> 00:04:01.649
Sirius.

00:04:02.960 --> 00:04:05.339
- What are you doing here?
- Answering your letter.

00:04:05.796 --> 00:04:08.296
You said you were worried
about Umbridge. What's she doing?

00:04:08.883 --> 00:04:10.801
Training you to kill half-breeds?

00:04:10.968 --> 00:04:13.971
- She's not letting us use magic at all.
- Well, I'm not surprised.

00:04:14.305 --> 00:04:18.350
The latest intelligence is that Fudge
doesn't want you trained in combat.

00:04:18.517 --> 00:04:19.560
Combat?

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:22.230
What does he think,
we're forming some sort of wizard army?

00:04:22.527 --> 00:04:24.023
That's exactly what he thinks.

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:27.992
That Dumbledore is assembling
his own forces to take on the Ministry.

00:04:29.153 --> 00:04:31.440
He's becoming more paranoid
by the minute.

00:04:32.698 --> 00:04:36.202
The others wouldn't want me
telling you this, Harry...

00:04:36.827 --> 00:04:39.143
...but things aren't going at all well
with the Order.

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:42.500
Fudge is blocking the truth
at every turn...

00:04:42.666 --> 00:04:45.870
...and these disappearances
are just how it started before.

00:04:47.463 --> 00:04:50.800
Voldemort is on the move.

00:04:51.091 --> 00:04:52.134
Well, what can we do?

00:04:53.031 --> 00:04:54.110
Someone's coming.

00:04:54.887 --> 00:04:56.324
I'm sorry I can't be of more help.

00:04:57.181 --> 00:05:01.126
But for now, at least,
it looks like you're on your own.

00:05:13.697 --> 00:05:15.133
He really is out there, isn't he?

00:05:17.868 --> 00:05:19.708
We've got to be able
to defend ourselves.

00:05:21.121 --> 00:05:23.775
And if Umbridge refuses to teach us how,
we need someone who will.

